{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your to-do list just got electrifying.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge devices, water plants, or tidy up\u2014but this house and garden are packed with peril . Sparks, faulty cords, and sneaky traps lurk in every corner. Will you survive?<br><br><strong>Pick Your Playstyle:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adventure Mode:</strong> Roam freely, dodge hazards, and enjoy the journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedrun Mode:</strong> Compete on leaderboards for the fastest cleanup!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635290/extras/giftasktwist1.gif?t=1746011903\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For Everyone:</strong> Tackle chores casually or race for the high score\u2014your choice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Electrifying Hazards:</strong> Dodge rogue appliances, frayed wires, and wet zones\u2014all while keeping your sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Risks in Every Corner:</strong> Explore every room and yard in a charming, danger-filled world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u201cThis isn\u2019t a chore\u2014it\u2019s an obstacle course!\u201d</i></strong><br>Dive in and turn mundane tasks into electrifying adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635290/extras/giftasktwist3.gif?t=1746011903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2635290?t=1746011903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746011903","capsule_image":"https://shared.ak